rought its own case. A hundred and fifteen charges. And three and a half years later, the commission found City guilty on almost all of them. Sham contracts with commercial partners. Revenues inflated and costs reduced by more than nine hundred million pounds. And, the commission found, concerted efforts to stop and frustrate the investigation itself."}